    "note": "本模组以 12 概念精髓（Life/Mana/Physical/Defences/Fire/Cold/Lightning/Chaos/Caster/Speed/Attribute/Attack）映射 PoE2 真实精髓家族（Body/Mind/Abrasion/Enhancement/Flames/Ice/Electricity/Ruin/Sorcery/Haste/Infinite/Battle）；只实装 Normal + Greater + Corrupted 三阶（图标即模组既有 26 枚），Lesser/Perfect 阶未做图标故未实装。分支键 = armour/accessory/weapon_1h/weapon_2h/caster，保底词直落 PREFIX（镜像符文 ENCHANT 层，精髓落原生前后缀）。",
    "data_layout": "每文件 {id,family,tier,level_req,location,branches:{<branch>:[{type,min,max}]}}，type=AdditionType 常量名，经 EssenceAdditionTypes 翻译。"
